    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_01",
      "hash64": "3530CCAE0E1378E7",
      "text": "Hallo! Ich bin Solena und kümmere mich um die\\nSonnflora der Arena.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_06",
      "hash64": "3530C9AE0E1373CE",
      "text": "Du bist hier, um dich an der Arenaprüfung zu\\nversuchen, richtig?\\c\\nDann werde ich den Sonnflora gleich mal sagen,\\ndass sie sich verteilen sollen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_07",
      "hash64": "3530CAAE0E137581",
      "text": "Sonn, Sonnflora!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_09",
      "hash64": "3530C4AE0E136B4F",
      "text": "Also gut, sie scheinen bereit zu sein!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_10",
      "hash64": "3533D1AE0E15B73D",
      "text": "Das heißt, die Arenaprüfung geht los!\\c\\nBitte kehre zum Sonnflora-Plaza zurück,\\nsobald du [VAR 0x0201(0001)] Sonnflora eingesammelt hast.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_11",
      "hash64": "3533D0AE0E15B58A",
      "text": "Los geht’s! Viel Spaß bei der Suche!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_02",
      "hash64": "3530CDAE0E137A9A",
      "text": "Momentan hast du [VAR 0x0201(0001)] Sonnflora bei dir.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_03",
      "hash64": "3530CEAE0E137C4D",
      "text": "Wenn du [VAR 0x0201(0002)] Sonnflora gefunden hast, bringe sie\\nbitte zu diesem Plaza hier.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_04",
      "hash64": "3530C7AE0E137068",
      "text": "Gratuliere! Du hast alle zehn Sonnflora gefunden.\\nDamit hast du die Arenaprüfung bestanden!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_05",
      "hash64": "3530C8AE0E13721B",
      "text": "Bitte gehe als Nächstes zum Empfang der\\nBolardin-Arena und erstatte dort Bericht.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "01E16E63DBE19BED",
      "text": "Möchtest du erneut an der Arenaprüfung\\nteilnehmen und Sonnflora suchen?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "01E16D63DBE19A3A",
      "text": "Sehr schön! Dann sammle [VAR 0x0201(0001)] Sonnflora ein und\\nbringe sie hierher auf den Plaza.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_08",
      "hash64": "01E16063DBE18423",
      "text": "Viel Erfolg!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_kusapoke_10",
      "hash64": "F905C97956842618",
      "text": "Wenn du die Stadt verlässt, musst du die\\nSonnflora beim nächsten Mal wieder von vorn\\r\\neinsammeln.\\c\\nMöchtest du die Stadt trotzdem verlassen?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_kusapoke_11",
      "hash64": "F905CA79568427CB",
      "text": "Du hast die Arenaprüfung aufgegeben!\\c\\nWenn du es noch einmal versuchen möchtest,\\ngehe zum Sonnflora-Plaza.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_kusapoke_12",
      "hash64": "F905CB795684297E",
      "text": "Möchtest du die Sonnflora-Suche aufgeben?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
